# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south-east

step The Dor'Danil Barrow Den: kill these as you meet them
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The Forsaken's camp lies in the woods south of Forest Song.
  tip Rusty chests lie around the Shadethicket furbolg camps west of the Forsaken; open them until one holds the pommel.
  tip Careful: Non-elite Forsaken of about level 28-30 guard the camp. Some of them are stealthed, and the ones around the table often aggro together.
  collect 5440 quest 1011 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Bottle of Disease
  collect 5519 quest 1027             -- Iron Pommel

step Fallen Sky Lake
  tip The Shadethicket Oracle walks the shore of Fallen Sky Lake, south-west of the chests; the Gleaming Crescent Pendant lies north of the lake, on the way.
  tip Careful: Other mobs, some of them underwater, sit near the island. Clear them first so they don't join the fight when you pull the Oracle.
  collect 5508 quest 1035 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Fallen Moonstone
  accept 98027 object 669176 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Gleaming Crescent Pendant: for Maliynn in Astranaar

step Satyrnaar
  tip North from the lake to the satyr camp of Satyrnaar, just west of Forest Song: the Circle of Imprisonment stands in it, and Kurothel's Knapsack lies beside it with the Vine-Wrapped Scroll.
  tip Careful: The Felmusk Rogues in Night Run often go stealthed, and Satyrnaar has satyr casters.
  interact 20352 quest 1140.2 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Circle of Imprisonment
  collect 281014 quest 98417 @81.7,49.2 map 1440 era only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Vine-Wrapped Scroll, from Kurothel's Knapsack

step Kayneth Stillwind
  tip Optional: Kayneth also offers Insane Druids, three level 32 druids deep in The Dor'Danil Barrow Den, a cave of quickly respawning, stealthed mobs, and back to her afterwards. It is above your level here: take it only if you are grouped or want the extra XP; the guide doesn't need it.
  turnin 1011 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 1012 optional
  turnin 98417 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Maseara Autumnmoon, a few steps east

