  tip Take the tunnel into the Howling Vale; the tome lies in the ruins at its west end. Careful: Terrowulf Fleshrippers and Shadow Weavers (28-30) stand in tight packs around the tome, and the Terrowulf Packlord, a level 32 rare, walks the vale. Pull the wolves one at a time from the tunnel and let the Packlord pass first.
