  tip South from Dal Bloodclaw's camp to Astranaar: Raene Wolfrunner in the inn, the flight master at the west end.
  turnin 1046                         -- Raene Wolfrunner
  turnin 1025 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Raene Wolfrunner
  turnin 1054 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Raene Wolfrunner

step Fly to Astranaar
